two-components               ok     two components, two flag sets: the first caller wins
    component A -> 0; component B -> -8, detail 2
    # THE FLAGS ARE A PROCESS-WIDE NEGOTIATION AND THE FIRST CALLER WINS.
    # Section 3 says a second call with different options fails, and treats
